.TH GAD 1 "November 2026" "Gad 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
gad \- queued file transfer manager for KDE
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B gad
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Gad manages file copies and moves with queuing, pause, resume, verification,
restoration and parallel transfers. The graphical interface provides
settings, language selection and links to the complete documentation.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --background
Start without opening the main window.
.TP
.B --paste-context URL
Paste the clipboard files into the specified folder.
.TP
.B --paste-current
Paste into the current supported file manager folder.
.TP
.B gad://show
Show the existing Gad window.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/gad/docs/
HTML and PDF documentation in the supported interface languages.
.SH AUTHOR
Terence Belleguic <hizo@free.fr>.
